      "en": "whom they set before the apostles. When they had prayed, they laid their hands on them.",
      "ko": "사도들 앞에 세우니 사도들이 기도하고 그들에게 안수하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "70691580a493fd8ae2d3da440b22f6665d0505596cdc49edcf054c09d775e764",
