      "en": "Stephen, full of faith and power, performed great wonders and signs among the people.",
      "ko": "스데반이 은혜와 권능이 충만하여 큰 기사와 표적을 민간에 행하니",
      "source_text_hash": "152ba377a566ecd058bbfa1eb2d710bbd5ff61d4d4512c8291e04f671a8c399c",
      "translation_text_hash": "096bf7d85f6444b5b53fbd171a6d1e710d94435fad28852c259546e0a0287997",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
