      "en": "They weren’t able to withstand the wisdom and the Spirit by which he spoke.",
      "ko": "스데반이 지혜와 성령으로 말함을 저희가 능히 당치 못하여",
      "source_text_hash": "551a445962793d7008a8968800699f8edd7b442cd4fa5b3820586e1ec08c47a7",
      "translation_text_hash": "bf48fadac249970a42a8413fe806e82541566247be44782bed9f523a544fe69b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
