      "en": "They stirred up the people, the elders, and the scribes, and came against him and seized him, then brought him in to the council,",
      "ko": "백성과 장로와 서기관들을 충동시켜 와서 잡아 가지고 공회에 이르러",
      "source_text_hash": "c355d7a71b445fc45c3d0efc79f82e265c3a0acd68164f0b1614e8a294f3f4eb",
      "translation_text_hash": "9221ff247568d12d1b9362c1c8b9ce8d3abda4af8ef2b0f8258ac2e397931117",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "백성과 장로와 서기관들을 충동시켜 와서 잡아 가지고 공회에 이르러"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "9221ff247568d12d1b9362c1c8b9ce8d3abda4af8ef2b0f8258ac2e397931117"
      ]
